    "description": "Welcome to Zoo - Happy Animals, where you'll tackle various tasks to maintain animal welfare in this colorful zoo simulator packed with entertaining mini-games.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc0a Master zoo management skills: Feed, groom, wash, and herd animals through maze puzzles, obstacle courses, and more.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc0a Engage in intuitive gameplay with increasing difficulty levels, offering challenges suitable for all animal enthusiasts.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc0a Care for alpacas, elephants, monkeys, lions, hippos, and even crocodiles with occasional cute gestures and rewards.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc0a Zoo promotes animal welfare awareness with simple gameplay and humorous elements while maintaining age-appropriate content.\r\n\r\nWant an idle game with adorable animals, fun challenges, and quirky humor? Download Zoo \u2013 Happy Animals now!\r\n\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://say.games/privacy-policy\r\nTerms of Use: https://say.games/terms-of-use",
